## RHYTHM CULTURE TEAMBUILDING WORKSHOP

{% columns %}
{% column %}
### Get Hands-On With African Drums

Everyone receives a real West African drum. Our facilitators introduce the instruments and teach some simple rhythms to get the group started.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Explore Rhythm & Teamwork

Through fun rhythm games, call-and-response activities and musical challenges, participants learn to listen, communicate and work together.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Bring The Rhythms Together

As everyone becomes familiar with their parts, we combine the individual rhythms to create a synchronised drumming ensemble. This is where the magic happens!
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Add Singing & African Dance

Depending on your event and preferences, we can introduce traditional songs, African dance and energetic movement activities.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Celebrate Together!

The workshop builds towards a shared musical experience. Everyone contributes to the final result, creating a memorable moment for the whole team.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

