## FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS

{% columns %}
{% column %}
### Do participants need previous drumming or dance experience?

Absolutely not! Our African drumming and dance workshops are designed for complete beginners. No musical or dance experience is necessary. Our professional facilitators guide everyone through the activities, making it easy for people of all ages, abilities and backgrounds to participate. All you need is a willingness to have a go and enjoy yourself!
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### How many people can participate?

We cater for corporate groups of varying sizes, from smaller teams to large-scale corporate events and conferences. Whether you're organising an intimate team-building session or a workshop for hundreds of participants, we can tailor the experience to suit your group. Get in touch to discuss your numbers and we'll work out the best approach for your event.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### What happens during a corporate drumming workshop?

Our workshops are energetic, interactive and full of surprises! We create an experience that builds throughout the session, bringing everyone together through rhythm, teamwork and plenty of laughter.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Do you provide all the drums and equipment?

Yes! We supply everything needed for your African drumming workshop, including the drums, percussion instruments and equipment. Our professional facilitators also bring the experience, energy and guidance to make your event a success.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
### Can workshops be held indoors or outdoors?

Absolutely! Our corporate drumming workshops can take place indoors or outdoors. We can work with conference venues, office spaces, function rooms, outdoor event spaces and retreat locations. We'll discuss your venue and setup requirements beforehand to ensure everything runs smoothly.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Can you travel to our corporate event?

Yes! We travel to you. Rhythm Culture provides corporate drumming and dance workshops across Australia. Whether your event is at your workplace, conference venue, retreat centre or another location, we'll organise the travel and bring everything needed for your workshop.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Can you tailor the workshop to our event theme?

Definitely! We understand that every corporate event has its own purpose and personality. Whether you're planning a conference, staff development day, workplace celebration, Christmas party or team retreat, we can tailor the workshop to suit your event, group size and objectives. Just let us know what you're planning and we'll create an experience to match.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
### Do you offer both African drumming and dance?

Yes! We offer both African drumming and traditional West African dance workshops. You can choose a drumming-only experience or combine drumming, singing and dance for an even more energetic and immersive event. African dance adds another dimension of movement, expression and fun. It's a fantastic way to get everyone moving, laughing and connecting!
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

